{"reviews":[{"id":"B099RQHLT7-0","r":5.0,"t":"Making a wig","x":"Making a wig it looks great so for.I might take  picture of when I finish it. First time making one so I am kind a slow with it.","h":31,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-1","r":5.0,"t":"Only used 2 1/2 packs","x":"Was not as soft as I thought it would be but my daughter loves it and it looks really pretty only use 2 1/2 packs and I didn\u2019t think six packs would be enough it turned out to be more then enough definitely would purchase again","h":30,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love it","x":"This looks so good on me. I get nothing but compliments!!","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-3","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy...","x":"Beautiful hair. Very soft. I love it. Will order again","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-4","r":5.0,"t":"My new favorite hair","x":"IMA be buying this hair for awhile... (Black girl from L.a here) ....you know how we are about our hair lol","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-5","r":5.0,"t":"Lightweight and Looks Natural","x":"This hair was my 3rd time purchase because of the light weight and natural  looking hair texture.  It does shed and frizz a little on the ends after 3rd week, but still worth the purchase.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-6","r":4.0,"t":"Great price and easy to install","x":"The passion twist crotchet hair was easy to install but after a week it will tangle a bit but it looks natural when it starts to fizz. I will be purchasing this hair again.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-7","r":4.0,"t":"Natural soft look, but the texture could be softer..","x":"Wish the texture was softer, but it has a natural look which I like. The length is perfect and the color is very close to the color of my hair.. Easy to twist and will see how it keeps up..","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-8","r":5.0,"t":"Full Bundles and Tangle Free","x":"[[VIDEOID:d4c9aa6005dfbc4e6c6d626bf17082d5]] There was a lot of hair left! It came with 6 bundles after I did my entire head I had a bundle and a half leftover. I used two extra pieces from some braiding hair to add some color. This was my first time doing passion twist on my hair and the hair was super easy to work with. Didn\u2019t shed or tangle came with colorful hair clips and the actual tool to apply the hair! This doesn\u2019t feel like most hair it isn\u2019t super rough and does not irritate my skin! ","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-9","r":5.0,"t":"Can do my fully head, perfect length for me","x":"[[VIDEOID:b49b972e6e5f0ab69779f8e55407d9af]] This is unfinished, but to Do my head minus two rows (2 rows of 4 parts on bottom)bit only took 2 small bags(came with 6)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-10","r":4.0,"t":"Ok","x":"Product curl was very small was looking for a little bigger","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-11","r":5.0,"t":"I\u2019m a newbie when it comes to weave.","x":"I\u2019m a newbie when it comes to weave. I chose this hair because of the color and I was not disappointed. The color was beautiful, the hair was soft, it was lightweight and springy. The only problem I had with it was the frizzy ends. After a couple of days it started to frizz on the ends, which made it look like babydoll hair. I could only cut it so much, but I cut it until I was satisfied.  Next time I\u2019ll try a little oil and see if that helps.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-12","r":2.0,"t":"Better hair to do a twist out Style then a natural crochet style","x":"So when I first received the pack a 6 in the past but it was just a little bit of hair so I was upset because I didn't think that it wasn't going to be enough to do the twist out Style just enough to do a natural crochet natural style. But it turns out that it is just enough to do a twist out Style the quality of the hair feels very great not naughty about this tangle it's a great value of hair to do twist out hair then natural crochet style.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-13","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"I hate this hair it frizzed  up in two days Even with me putting a bonnet on it at night and I have to now take it out ...paid $150 to have it put in . will never ever buy it again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-14","r":1.0,"t":"Nightmare hair","x":"This hair is absolutely horrible!!! As soon as i removed hair from bag is is already frizzy and  look as if it was already used! Very stiff!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-15","r":3.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"I love the curl pattern.  I just thought there would be more hair per pack. I will have to buy more hair to do my whole head","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-16","r":1.0,"t":"Not Useable","x":"Hair was not as expected. It was soft and right length but was not prelooped which makes it harder to install.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-17","r":1.0,"t":"I will.mever buy again","x":"Wanted it for short bob the worst hair it was so stringing and kept coming out in strands","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-18","r":5.0,"t":"Would buy again","x":"I got this to do my 5 year olds hair for a trip that we where taking and it was her 1st time having hair in her head she was so excited \ud83d\ude02 lol she calls it her WIG and I was worried about it being to heavy on her head but once I got it done she loved I loved it the hair was so light she could not tell a difference and it is really soft and easy to use put in and take out easy thank you","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-19","r":5.0,"t":"I would buy this again","x":"Got this for a friend. She wanted to experiment with new hair styles but was wary of not liking.  She totally loved and it looked great. The hair is surprisingly not heavy. I kept my hands moisturized to twist and it worked well.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-20","r":3.0,"t":"Love the hair","x":"I would recommend buying more hair. There is not enough hair in the pack depending on what style you are planning to do. Other than that, the hair is lightweight, soft, and didn't have problems with tangles. I will buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-21","r":5.0,"t":"Really great hair","x":"I have to say, when i first saw the price i was a bit scared to purchase but it is worth it. It is very light, has no smell and great quality...wouod recommend to anyome to buy.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-22","r":5.0,"t":"Well worth the money","x":"The individual strands are a bit small but I just combine two or three depending on the look I\u2019m going for. I love these. I am definitely getting my money\u2019s worth","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-23","r":2.0,"t":"Dissatisfied with the quality hair","x":"Not good quality hair, if I haven\u2019t already pull a few packs I would\u2019ve returned it back. I\u2019m being nice giving a 2 star on this review.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B099RQHLT7-24","r":5.0,"t":"So soft and beautiful","x":"The shipping was so fast and I got the hair just as it is described! I will definitely be buying again. Very soft and beautiful hair!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the hair soft, natural-looking, and lightweight, and say they would buy it again.","cites":[4,5,6,8,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the hair frizzes or tangles, especially at the ends, after a short time.","cites":[6,7,12,14,15]},{"text":"Reviewers report the bundles are plentiful, with hair left over after finishing their style.","cites":[2,9,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the texture is not as soft as expected or is stiff.","cites":[2,8,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers praise the color and easy installation.","cites":[7,8,12]}]},"qa":[]}